/// Return a fallback `Order` in case the first argument is `Eq`.
///
/// ## Examples
///
/// ```gleam
/// import gleam/int
///
/// assert break_tie(in: int.compare(1, 1), with: Lt) == Lt
/// ```
///
/// ```gleam
